===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
'''sclera''' (''plural'' '''scleras''' or '''sclerae''')

# {{anatomy}} The white of the [[eye]]. It is the tough outer coat of the eye that covers the [[eyeball]] except for the [[cornea]].

